            "provenance": [],
            "range": null,
            "why": "Monitor sends are pre-fader, so moving a channel fader for the room does not change what the musician hears. Check on this console whether that tap is before or after the compressor. With wedges, compression on a vocal also reaches the wedge unless the monitor send is taken before the compressor.",
